+
+### Session-scoped MCP injection
+
+`agent.session_open` receives `mcpServers` initialized from the launch configuration.
+Return a new map to add, replace or remove servers for this opening only. These edits
+are sent to the provider on create, resume, refresh and history opens; they are not
+written to the stored agent configuration. Session identity remains read-only.
+Plugins should skip `purpose: "history"` when their tools are interactive only.
+Built-in providers and custom provider `session.open.config.mcpServers` receive the
+result. A provider that cannot honor these MCP servers rejects the interactive open.
